  "claim": "A TV show created by Michael G. Moye and Ron Leavitt aired on May 2, 2006 in Chile. The writer-producer who co-hosted a show with Terri-Rae Elmer worked on this show.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Casado con hijos (Chile). Sentence: Casado con hijos is a Chilean television series and remake of the American tv show \"Married... with Children\".\nPage: Casado con hijos (Chile). Sentence: It aired on May 2, 2006, and ended on October 15, 2008.\nPage: Married... with Children. Sentence: Married... with Children is an American television sitcom that aired on Fox, created by Michael G. Moye and Ron Leavitt.\nPage: Doug McIntyre. Sentence: Known for his active involvement in local politics and his passion for jazz and the \"Great American Songbook\", McIntyre's background includes work as television writer-producer with credits including \"Married... with Children\", \"WKRP in Cincinnati\", \"Full House\", \"Mike Hammer\", and the critically acclaimed PBS series, \"Liberty's Kids\", which earned McIntyre a Humanitas Prize nomination.\nPage: Terri-Rae Elmer. Sentence: Following KFI Terri-rae became the co-hosts the morning show on KABC 790 with Doug McIntyre.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Casado con hijos (Chile). Sentence: Casado con hijos is a Chilean television series and remake of the American tv show \"Married... with Children\".\nPage: Casado con hijos (Chile). Sentence: It aired on May 2, 2006, and ended on October 15, 2008.\nPage: Married... with Children. Sentence: Married... with Children is an American television sitcom that aired on Fox, created by Michael G. Moye and Ron Leavitt.\nPage: Doug McIntyre. Sentence: Known for his active involvement in local politics and his passion for jazz and the \"Great American Songbook\", McIntyre's background includes work as television writer-producer with credits including \"Married... with Children\", \"WKRP in Cincinnati\", \"Full House\", \"Mike Hammer\", and the critically acclaimed PBS series, \"Liberty's Kids\", which earned McIntyre a Humanitas Prize nomination.\nPage: Terri-Rae Elmer. Sentence: Following KFI Terri-rae became the co-hosts the morning show on KABC 790 with Doug McIntyre.",
