        "original_id": "6c82f7c6-c33e-5f2f-9932-0d269f649312",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Casado con hijos, Married... with Children, WKRP in Cincinnati, Full House, Mike Hammer, Liberty's Kids\n- People: Michael G. Moye, Ron Leavitt, Doug McIntyre, Terri-Rae Elmer\n- Companies: Fox, PBS, KABC 790, KFI\n- Topics: Television series remakes, television writing, radio hosting\n\nFacts:\n- Married... with Children is an American television sitcom that aired on Fox and was created by Michael G. Moye and Ron Leavitt.\n- Casado con hijos is a Chilean television series that is a remake of the American show Married... with Children.\n- Casado con hijos premiered on May 2, 2006, and ended on October 15, 2008.\n- Doug McIntyre worked as a television writer-producer on Married... with Children, WKRP in Cincinnati, Full House, Mike Hammer, and the PBS series Liberty's Kids.\n- Liberty's Kids earned Doug McIntyre a Humanitas Prize nomination.\n- Doug McIntyre is known for active involvement in local politics and for a passion for jazz and the Great American Songbook.\n- After KFI, Terri-Rae Elmer became a co-host of the morning show on KABC 790 with Doug McIntyre.",
